Version 4
SHEET 1 3200 1800
TEXT 100 40 Left 2 ;========================================================================================
TEXT 100 70 Left 2 ;PREDICTIVE LOOK-AHEAD STABILIZED CONTINUOUS-TIME DELTA-SIGMA MODULATOR (3-BIT FLASH + RESONATOR)
TEXT 100 100 Left 2 ;Parasitic Bitline Integration + Local Resonator Notch + Multi-Cycle Look-Ahead (d1=0.78, d2=0.27)
TEXT 100 130 Left 2 ;========================================================================================

* 1. MASTER CLOCK GENERATOR
TEXT 100 200 Left 2 ;[1. MASTER SAMPLING CLOCK (1 GHz)]
SYMBOL voltage 140 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Vclk
SYMATTR Value PULSE(0 1 0 20p 20p 480p 1n)
WIRE 140 240 140 276
FLAG 140 240 clk
WIRE 140 340 140 390
FLAG 140 390 0

* 2. INPUT CURRENT SOURCE (NEURAL ACTIVATION)
TEXT 400 200 Left 2 ;[2. INPUT NEURAL CURRENT SOURCE]
SYMBOL bi 440 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Iin
SYMATTR Value I=25u+15u*sin(2*pi*31.25MEG*time)
WIRE 440 240 440 260
FLAG 440 240 vbl
WIRE 440 340 440 390
FLAG 440 390 0

* 3. FIRST INTEGRATOR: BITLINE PARASITIC CAPACITANCE
TEXT 700 200 Left 2 ;[3. PARASITIC BITLINE CAPACITANCE & RESONATOR FEEDBACK]
SYMBOL cap 720 270 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Cbl
SYMATTR Value 100f
SYMATTR SpiceLine ic=0.25
WIRE 736 240 736 286
FLAG 736 240 vbl
WIRE 736 334 736 390
FLAG 736 390 0

SYMBOL res 840 270 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Rbl
SYMATTR Value 500k
WIRE 856 240 856 286
FLAG 856 240 vbl
WIRE 856 366 856 390
FLAG 856 390 0

* Local Resonator Feedback: omitted to preserve negative feedback margin

* 4. 3-BIT FEEDBACK CURRENT DAC
TEXT 1150 200 Left 2 ;[4. 3-BIT FEEDBACK CURRENT DAC (50 uA)]
SYMBOL bi 1200 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Bidac
SYMATTR Value I=50u*((V(y_del)+1.0)/2.0)
WIRE 1200 240 1200 260
FLAG 1200 240 vbl
WIRE 1200 340 1200 390
FLAG 1200 390 0

* 5. SECOND INTEGRATOR: ACTIVE OTA + C2
TEXT 1450 200 Left 2 ;[5. SECOND CONTINUOUS INTEGRATOR (OTA + C2)]
SYMBOL bv 1500 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Vref_src
SYMATTR Value V=0.25
WIRE 1500 240 1500 276
FLAG 1500 240 ref
WIRE 1500 356 1500 390
FLAG 1500 390 0

SYMBOL bi 1700 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Gota
SYMATTR Value I=100u*(V(vbl)-V(ref))
WIRE 1700 240 1700 260
FLAG 1700 240 v2
WIRE 1700 340 1700 390
FLAG 1700 390 0

SYMBOL cap 1860 270 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName C2
SYMATTR Value 400f
SYMATTR SpiceLine ic=0
WIRE 1876 240 1876 286
FLAG 1876 240 v2
WIRE 1876 334 1876 390
FLAG 1876 390 0

SYMBOL res 1980 270 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Rleak2
SYMATTR Value 10MEG
WIRE 1996 240 1996 286
FLAG 1996 240 v2
WIRE 1996 366 1996 390
FLAG 1996 390 0

