* 7. PREDICTIVE SUMMING JUNCTION & 3-BIT FLASH QUANTIZER
TEXT 1300 550 Left 2 ;[7. PREDICTIVE SUMMING JUNCTION & 3-BIT FLASH QUANTIZER]
* Predictive Compensation Network (d1 = 0.7800, d2 = 0.2711)
SYMBOL bv 1400 620 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Bpred
SYMATTR Value V=0.7800*V(y_d1)+0.2711*V(y_d2)
WIRE 1400 600 1400 636
FLAG 1400 600 v_comp
WIRE 1400 716 1400 750
FLAG 1400 750 0

* Predictive Summing Node: Vq = c1*(V(vbl)-0.25) + c2*V(v2) - V(v_comp)
SYMBOL bv 1640 620 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Bvq
SYMATTR Value V=1.864*(V(vbl)-0.25)+1.520*V(v2)-V(v_comp)
WIRE 1640 600 1640 636
FLAG 1640 600 vq
WIRE 1640 716 1640 750
FLAG 1640 750 0

* 3-Bit Flash Quantizer (8-level characteristic)
SYMBOL bv 1880 620 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Byout
SYMATTR Value V=table(V(vq), -0.857, -1.0, -0.571, -0.714, -0.286, -0.429, 0.0, -0.143, 0.286, 0.143, 0.571, 0.429, 0.857, 0.714, 1.0, 1.0)
WIRE 1880 600 1880 636
FLAG 1880 600 y_out
WIRE 1880 716 1880 750
FLAG 1880 750 0

